'''Dober P.D''' (ダディ, ''Dadi'', '''Daddy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.6 Update|Version 2.2.6]].

