==Trivia==
*"Dober" is a shortening of "[[Wikipedia:Dobermann|Dobermann]]", a breed of dog whose powerful jaws, intelligence and agility make them a popular choice for a guard dog, thus explaining his name, as well as how his description associates him with the police. Furthermore, P.D can also be considered an initialism for "Doberman Pinscher". He is also introduced in [[Alcatraz]], which is named after the infamous prison in California.
**P.D could also stand for Police Department, Police Deputy, Police Doberman, or Police Dog.
*His description mentions that he is seen a lot with [[Celeboodle]], which is shown in [[Jailer in the Morgue]] and its remake, [[Slave to Instinct]], where Dober P.D is spawned with a large amount of them.

